Run every build-time host tool through the scoped runtime launcher.
Origin: EmberBSD contributors (AI-assisted), not submitted upstream.
gn-compiled-action-scoped-runtime.patch covers compiled_action only. V8
(torque, mksnapshot, bytecode_builtins_list_generator,
gen-regexp-special-case), Electron's natives code cache, perfetto's
protozero_descriptor_diff and v8_context_snapshot_generator run host tools
through v8/tools/run.py, perfetto gn/run_binary.py and gn_run_binary.py
directly, so they load the installed std::__1 abseil beside the __ember1
stage (torque: dyld missing DeallocateBackingArray<__ember1>). Export the
same launcher/view arguments and inputs and wire them into all of them.

